==================== Input ====================
# An implicit key must stay on one line: when the block-collection value pins
# the hardline separator, a key that overflows the width flips to the explicit
# form (Prettier's `ifBreak(explicit, implicit, {groupId})` on the grouped key),
# while a fitting key (the last item) stays implicit.
[AlphaLongTableName, BravoLongTableName, CharlieLongTableName, DeltaLongTableName, EchoLongTableName]:
  scrubber: undefinedScrubber
{AlphaLongTableName: 1, BravoLongTableName: 2, CharlieLongTableName: 3, DeltaLongTableName: 4}:
  scrubber: undefinedScrubber
[a, b]:
  x: 1
# A forced break inside the key (comment-pinned flow collection) also flips to
# the explicit form, regardless of width — width trials cannot see it
? [aaa, # pinned
   bbb]
: x: 1
? [ccc, # pinned
   ddd]
: value

